  triage:title "runtime_health.rs RULE-003 threshold still exceeded (line count reduced but not resolved)" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health.rs line count is now 1271 lines, improved from the previous 1356 lines recorded in AI27-ARCH-001, but still exceeds the RULE-003 hard limit of 1250 lines. This finding carries forward the unresolved RULE-003 violation from the prior sprint. The component adds new health-check logic for peer recovery coordinator coordination, which contributes to the continued line-count pressure. While the absolute line count improved, the file remains out of compliance. Fix required: refactor runtime_health.rs to extract distinct responsibilities (e.g., peer recovery health checks, overall host health aggregation, external reporting) into separate modules to bring line count under 1250." ;
